    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d223">

                <pb facs="0447" n="373" sameAs="frus:frus1941-43/pg373"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Halifax</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to The British Secretary of State for
                        Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eden</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">most immediate</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-29">December 29, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6087. Your telegram no. 7304 first paragraph.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d223-f1"/>
                    Czechoslovakia was included as tenth country in list. Please check decyphering
                    as telegram as sent from here was correct.</p>
                <p>Luxembourg was however omitted.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
